{"step_index":507,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-17T12:00:40Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-17T16:00:40+04:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-17T16:00:40+04:00\n\nThe command exited with code 0.\nOutput:\n<truncated 1 lines>\n+    branches: [ \"Baba-Koby\" ]\r\n+\r\n+jobs:\r\n+  build:\r\n+\r\n+    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\r\n+    strategy:\r\n+      max-parallel: 4\r\n+      matrix:\r\n+        python-version: [3.7, 3.8, 3.9]\r\n+\r\n+    steps:\r\n+    - uses: actions/checkout@v4\r\n+    - name: Set up Python ${{ matrix.python-version }}\r\n+      uses: actions/setup-python@v3\r\n+      with:\r\n+        python-version: ${{ matrix.python-version }}\r\n+    - name: Install Dependencies\r\n+      run: |\r\n+        python -m pip install --upgrade pip\r\n+        pip install -r requirements.txt\r\n+    - name: Run Tests\r\n+      run: |\r\n+        python manage.py test\r\n\r\ncommit f99f3d82e5fc72c8ff78765494dcc55a8ab9a215\r\nAuthor: Amit Samy <a.samy@outremer-telecom.fr>\r\nDate:   Thu Sep 17 12:06:40 2026 +0400\r\n\r\n    feat: add Ansible configuration, inventory, and check-nginx playbook\r\n---\r\n README.md                 | 69 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-\r\n ansible.cfg               |  3 ++-\r\n inventory.yml             | 15 +++++++++++\r\n playbooks/check-nginx.yml | 67 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\r\n 4 files changed, 152 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\r\n\r\ndiff --git a/README.md b/README.md\r\nindex b18aef9..f8ab5b9 100644\r\n--- a/README.md\r\n+++ b/README.md\r\n@@ -1 +1,68 @@\r\n-# LINUX\r\n\\ No newline at end of file\r\n+# ansible\r\n+\r\n+Projet Ansible personnel pour l'administration, le dépannage et le\r\n+durcissement sécurité de plusieurs serveurs.\r\n+\r\n+## Utilisation\r\n+\r\n+`ansible.cfg` n'est chargé que si les commandes sont lancées **depuis ce\r\n+dossier** (ou avec `ANSIBLE_CONFIG=~/ansible/ansible.cfg` exporté).\r\n+\r\n+**Contre `localhost` sur cette machine, ne pas utiliser `-K`** (voir\r\n+\"sudo-rs\" ci-dessous) — lancer tout le process déjà en root :\r\n+\r\n+```bash\r\n+cd ~/ansible\r\n+sudo ansible-playbook playbooks/check-nginx.yml\r\n+```\r\n+\r\n+Contre un hôte **distant** (SSH), `-K` fonctionne normalement (sauf si cet\r\n+hôte utilise au\n<truncated 4221 bytes>\n+    - name: Statut du service nginx\r\n+      ansible.builtin.command: systemctl is-active nginx\r\n+      register: _nginx_service\r\n+      changed_when: false\r\n+      failed_when: false\r\n+\r\n+    - name: Test de syntaxe de la config nginx\r\n+      ansible.builtin.command: nginx -t\r\n+      register: _nginx_test\r\n+      changed_when: false\r\n+      failed_when: false\r\n+\r\n+    - name: Contenu de sites-enabled\r\n+      ansible.builtin.command: ls -la /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/\r\n+      register: _sites_enabled\r\n+      changed_when: false\r\n+      failed_when: false\r\n+\r\n+    - name: Liens symboliques cassés dans sites-enabled\r\n+      ansible.builtin.command: find /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/ -xtype l\r\n+      register: _broken_links\r\n+      changed_when: false\r\n+      failed_when: false\r\n+\r\n+    - name: sites-enabled est-il inclus par nginx.conf\r\n+      ansible.builtin.command: grep -n \"include.*sites-enabled\" /etc/nginx/nginx.conf\r\n+      register: _sites_enabled_included\r\n+      changed_when: false\r\n+      failed_when: false\r\n+\r\n+    - name: Contenu de chaque domaine dans sites-available\r\n+      ansible.builtin.shell: >-\r\n+        for f in /etc/nginx/sites-available/*; do\r\n+          echo \"===== $f =====\";\r\n+          cat \"$f\";\r\n+          echo;\r\n+        done\r\n+      register: _sites_available_content\r\n+      changed_when: false\r\n+      failed_when: false\r\n+\r\n+    - name: Résultat\r\n+      ansible.builtin.debug:\r\n+        msg:\r\n+          - \"service nginx actif : {{ _nginx_service.stdout | default('') }}\"\r\n+          - \"config valide : {{ _nginx_test.rc == 0 }}\"\r\n+          - \"détail du test de config : {{ _nginx_test.stderr_lines }}\"\r\n+          - \"sites-enabled : {{ _sites_enabled.stdout_lines }}\"\r\n+          - \"liens cassés dans sites-enabled : {{ _broken_links.stdout_lines }}\"\r\n+          - \"sites-enabled inclus dans nginx.conf : {{ _sites_enabled_included.rc == 0 }}\"\r\n+\r\n+    - name: Configs de sites-available (un domaine par fichier)\r\n+      ansible.builtin.debug:\r\n+        var: _sites_available_content.stdout_lines\r\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
